# A case is copied into a disposable work dir to be built, so nothing here
# is ever a build output. These two are what a hand-run `cargo` inside a
# case directory leaves behind: the lock file of a zero-dependency crate
# (regenerated in the copy, identical every time) and the target dir, which
# ordinarily lives in whatever CARGO_TARGET_DIR the run names.
target/
Cargo.lock
